{"id":"st12-2","designation":"ST 12-2","title":"SMPTE Time and Control Code — Transmission of Time Code in the Ancillary Data Space","state":"stabilized","suite":"12","official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st12-2/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st12-2/","checked_at":"2026-11-11"},"scope":"This standard defines a transmission format for conveyance of linear (LTC) or vertical interval (VITC) time code data formatted according to SMPTE ST 12-1 in 8-, 10-, or 12-bit digital television data interfaces. Time code information is transmitted in the ancillary data space as defined in SMPTE ST 291-1. Multiple time codes can be transmitted within a single digital video data stream. Other information (such as real time clock, film transfer, DTTR tape timer, and user-defined information) may also be carried in the ancillary time code packet. This standard is applicable to digital television data interfaces, whether high definition or standard definition.","outline":[],"definitions":[],"keywords":[{"term":"SMPTE ST 12-1","zh":"时间码","abbr":"ST 12-1","category":"tv","source":"curated"},{"term":"Ancillary Data","zh":"辅助数据","abbr":"","category":"tv","source":"curated"},{"term":"Analog Television Recording","zh":"模拟电视录制","abbr":"","category":"tv","source":"curated"},{"term":"ANC","zh":"","abbr":"ANC","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"DID","zh":"","abbr":"DID","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"SDID","zh":"","abbr":"SDID","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"UDW","zh":"","abbr":"UDW","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"HDTV","zh":"","abbr":"HDTV","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"SDTV","zh":"","abbr":"SDTV","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"VITC","zh":"","abbr":"VITC","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"LTC","zh":"","abbr":"LTC","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"ATC","zh":"","abbr":"ATC","category":"other","source":"acronym"}],"refs":[{"id":"st12-1","designa